beQ0MvwHNg08w","date":"2018-05-18T02:55:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9188957214355469,"text_excerpt":"Drove by and saw this place attached to the Double Tree near Harrah's and I'm glad we did. Got the Kentucky fried chicken wrap, the blackened chicken sandwich and the fried chicken sandwich. The meal was to-go and it was hot and seasoned right when we got back to the hotel. The chicken breasts were thick, juicy and seasoned just right. Fries were crisp and the ranch dip was very good. TV screens around the restaurant to catch most games on this night. Great service!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"H0nX4N4N3AIDheuIcbVYkw","photo_id":"To6aWBbRDZWaGlmz290nHQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/To6aWBbRDZWaGlmz290nHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9047183990478516},{"business_id":"H0nX4N4N3AIDheuIcbVYkw","photo_id":"fmoBJwuQLQwwD_RpZkLQig","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/fmoBJwuQLQwwD_RpZkLQig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9018661975860596},{"business_id":"H0nX4N4N3AIDheuIcbVYkw","photo_id":"LBZy_sAL-ysGbcBlDXu9bQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LBZy_sAL-ysGbcBlDXu9bQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8914338946342468},{"business_id":"H0nX4N4N3AIDheuIcbVYkw","photo_id":"XyYsOGc2ckh1MnhIZnHOjQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XyYsOGc2ckh1MnhIZnHOjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.880915105342865}]},"notebook_case":null}
